      "exercise": "732",
      "grading": "auto",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "a) $\\lg100=2$；b) $\\lg10000000=7$；c) $\\lg0.001=-3$；d) $\\lg0.000001=-6$；e) $\\lg\\sqrt{10}=\\frac{1}{2}$；f) $\\lg(100\\sqrt{10})=2.5$。依据是 $10^r=b\\iff\\lg b=r$，这里 $b>0$。",
      "parts": [
        {"label": "a)", "judge": "exact", "expected": ["\\lg100=2"]},
        {"label": "b)", "judge": "exact", "expected": ["\\lg10000000=7"]},
        {"label": "c)", "judge": "exact", "expected": ["\\lg0.001=-3"]},
        {"label": "d)", "judge": "exact", "expected": ["\\lg0.000001=-6"]},
        {"label": "e)", "judge": "exact", "expected": ["\\lg\\sqrt{10}=\\frac{1}{2}"]},
        {"label": "f)", "judge": "exact", "expected": ["\\lg(100\\sqrt{10})=2.5"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "exercise": "733",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "各真数均为正数，把它写成 $10$ 的幂即可：a) $1000=10^3$；b) $100000=10^5$；c) $\\frac{1}{10000}=10^{-4}$；d) $\\sqrt[3]{10}=10^{1/3}$；e) $\\sqrt{0.1}=10^{-1/2}$；f) $\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{100}=10^{-3/2}$；g) $\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{1000}}{10}=10^{-1/4}$；h) $\\frac{100}{\\sqrt[3]{10}}=10^{5/3}$，故对数是 $\\frac{5}{3}=1\\frac{2}{3}$；i) $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt[4]{40}}=\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{4}{40}}=10^{-1/4}$。由常用对数定义，全部等式成立。",
      "parts": []
    },
