      "exercise": "735",
      "grading": "auto",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "所有解均满足 $x>0$。a) $x=10$；b) $x=0.001$；c) $x=\\sqrt{10}$；d) $x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}$；e) $x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{100}}$；f) $x=100\\sqrt{10}$；g) $x=1$；h) $x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{10}}$。统一使用 $\\lg x=r\\iff x=10^r$。",
      "parts": [
        {"label": "a)", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["10"]},
